# held/props/linen: a roll of linen bandage for the Kneel posture (PROPS, P2b; variant 0, binding a friend's wounds): the
# roll in the right hand, its strip running to the left hand low before the knee. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Around the
# pose arms' grips, anchored on the right shoulder.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held linen
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

